    "gate": "widget-render-check (G10) — visual regression",
    "note": "Per (widget·beat, theme): {v:visible-count, sig:paint-hash} per step — the frozen healthy render. The gate HARD-fails on DRIFT (mark added/removed, step collapsed, fill/stroke/halo change). After an INTENTIONAL visual change run `node _audit/widget-render-check.mjs --update-baseline`, then REVIEW the git diff before committing. A new widget (L7…) auto-adds its row on the first --update-baseline.",
